# NK conformance driver nkc-etw (trace providers).
#
# The first request returns what the driver saw of ETW registration and
# writes with nobody listening, WMI registration of its device and the
# requests that brings, bugcheck-reason callbacks and system
# information; the second, the routines Microsoft's WPP recorder looks
# up by name. 32 bits each, ending with 0x4E4B4321. What each value
# means is written beside it in nk-fixtures nkc/nkc-etw.c.

load nkc-etw nkc-etw.sys
open d \Device\NkcEtw
ioctl d 00222000 - 16384
ioctl d 00222004 - 16384
close d
unload nkc-etw
